<rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>some.pics (中文)</title><link>https://some.pics</link><description>只是网上的一些图片。</description><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Thu, 13 Aug 2026 00:34:23 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title/><link>https://some.pics/6a7d110c99cc8</link><description>&lt;p&gt;一幅唐老鸭的钢笔素描。我找不到原作者来署名。这是我上班时趁休息时间花了几天画的。唐老鸭摆着一张臭脸，像是要从纸面上冲出来似的。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A pen drawing of Donald Duck. I can't find the original artist to attribute it to. I drew this over a few days at work when I needed a break. Donald is making a grumpy face, while sharing to burst through the page." height="4080" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/shroomy/6a7d110c99cc8.jpg" width="3072"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://shroomy.some.pics"&gt;@shroomy&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 13 Aug 2026 00:34:23 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title/><link>https://some.pics/6a7cf72732c0f</link><description>&lt;p&gt;荷兰日食，2026年12月8日，20:11。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Solar eclipse in NL, 12/08/2026, 20:11." height="2729" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/sybrand/6a7cf72732c0f.jpg" width="4840"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://sybrand.some.pics"&gt;@sybrand&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 12 Aug 2026 22:43:54 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title/><link>https://some.pics/6a7cbe7b83bce</link><description>&lt;p&gt;阳光照在棚屋的墙壁上，2026年8月12日的日食几乎完全遮蔽太阳的景象，在多处清晰可见。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="The wall of a shed in the sunlight, where the near total occlusion of the sun by the eclipse of 2026.08.12 can be very clearly seen in multiple places." height="3024" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/maz/6a7cbe7b83bce.jpg" width="4032"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://maz.some.pics"&gt;@maz&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 12 Aug 2026 18:42:09 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title/><link>https://some.pics/6a7cac6574f8e</link><description>&lt;p&gt;数字上涨！目前有七支钢笔已上墨。#FountainPens&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Number go up! Seven fountain pens currently inked. #FountainPens" height="4032" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/penaddict/6a7cac6574f8e.jpg" width="3024"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://penaddict.some.pics"&gt;@penaddict&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 12 Aug 2026 17:24:59 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title/><link>https://some.pics/6a7caa4e68612</link><description>&lt;p&gt;Alfie Jacques大使奖 9月11日星期五 贝勒维尔乡村俱乐部 alfieward.com&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="alfie in his workshop making a wooden stick" height="1350" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/adjb/6a7caa4e68612.png" width="1080"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://adjb.some.pics"&gt;@adjb&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 12 Aug 2026 17:16:01 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>